  "body": "Single Level Living In Milford\r\n\r\nEnjoy easy care living in this prime Milford location, where convenience and lifestyle come together.\r\n\r\nWell-presented throughout, this appealing single-level home offers one bedroom and bathroom, a practical galley-style kitchen together with a sunny dining and living area. \r\nPositioned in an elevated, sunny setting, the property is constructed in reliable brick and comes with covered parking adding to its practicality and appeal.\r\n\r\nProperty highlights:\r\n- No Body Corporate fees\r\n- Prime Milford location\r\n- Elevated, sunny position\r\n- Reliable brick construction\r\n- Covered parking\r\n- Rental appraisal of $550-$600 per week\r\n- Easy walk to Milford shops and transport\r\n- Close to North Shore Hospital and local amenities\r\n\r\nWhether you're a first home buyer, a downsizer, looking for a lock up and leave or simply looking for an affordable foothold in one of the North Shore's most desirable locations, this is an opportunity worth viewing. \r\n\r\nEasy care Milford lifestyle living could be yours NOW! \r\n\r\nAuction Thursday 29th October 2026 from 12pm. In Rooms, 128 Hurstmere Road Takapuna (unless sold prior)\r\nTO DOWNLOAD PROPERTY DOCUMENTS: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/HAP9",
